<?xml version="1.0" encoding="utf-8"?>
<!--
  Notification-only icon: a flat white silhouette (status-bar icons must be a single
  opaque shape on transparent background -- the system applies its own tint). This is a
  simplified watermelon-slice wedge (rind arc + straight base) with three small circular
  seed cutouts, distinct from the multi-color app icon (ic_watermelon_logo.xml), which is
  not notification-safe. Simplification of the seed placement is a conservative,
  clearly-legible choice for 24x24dp status-bar rendering rather than a pixel-accurate
  trace of the full-color logo.
-->
